From {{der|en|enm|flet||floor of a house; house}}, from {{der|en|ang|flet}}, {{m|ang|flett||the ground; the floor of a house; house; dwelling}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*flatją||a flat or level surface, level ground, floor, hallway}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*plad-||flat, broad}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|vlet||vessel}}, {{cog|nds|Flet||an upper bedroom}}, {{cog|de|Fletz}}, {{m|de|Flötz||level ground, threshing floor, hallway, set of rooms or benches}}. More at {{l|en|flat}}.

